        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It occurred to me today that Vengeance is probably Sentinel Comics&#39;s answer to Marvel&#39;s Secret Wars - presumably most if not all of the villains are presumed to have premiered in other comics, and Vengeance was them all coming back as part of Blade&#39;s master plan.&nbsp; Anyone else have similar thoughts?&nbsp; I&#39;m trying to imagine a story epic enough to require this many freaking characters in it, and it&#39;s quite a tall order....</p>",
